{
  "metadata": {
    "description": "Token savings from Mubit memory across two continual/context learning benchmarks",
    "methodology": "ICL (in-context learning) accumulates conversation history, growing linearly. Mubit retrieves fixed-size lessons, keeping prompt size constant. For context-learning tasks, Mubit indexes documents once and retrieves only relevant chunks per query."
  },
